his matrix defines\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 vulnerability,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 its\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 manifestation\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 an\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 AI\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 model,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 biological\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 analogy,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the specific Integra protocol engineered to neutralize it.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb2\f1\fs15\b0\i0\par
