\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb4\f1\fs14\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s3\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\qj\sl240\slmult1\sb240{\*\bkmkstart TASK 3: DETAILED SYSTEMS WORKFLOW (THE L}{\*\bkmkend TASK 3: DETAILED SYSTEMS WORKFLOW (THE L}\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark72}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark72}\f1\fs32\cf11 TASK\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 3:\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 DETAILED\expnd6\expndtw30  \expnd0\expndtw0 SYSTEMS\expnd6\expndtw29  \expnd0\expndtw0 WORKFLOW\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 (THE\expnd6\expndtw30  \expnd0\expndtw0 LIQUIDITY\expnd5\expndtw26  \expnd0\expndtw-2 PUMP)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\ri394\qj\sl240\slmult1\sb182\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Friday Fortress is a cybernetic, self-evolving organism. This workflow maps the precise thermodynamic flow of capital across the three temporal scales: Quantum (Daily Entropy), Causality (Medium-Term Relationships), and Cosmological (Macroeconomic Epochs).\par\pard\plain\s5\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\qj\sl240\slmult1\sb180{\*\bkmkstart CYCLE 1: THE INHALATION (System 3 - The }{\*\bkmkend CYCLE 1: THE INHALATION (System 3 - The }\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark73}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark73}\f2\fs28\b1\charscalex110\cf11 CYCLE\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 1:\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 THE\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 INHALATION\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 (System\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 3\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 -\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Hunter)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\qj\sl240\slmult1\sb181\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 process\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 aggressive\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 external\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 energy\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 extraction\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Quantum\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw-2 scale.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri651\sl242\slmult1\sb177\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Margin\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Lock:\expnd0\expndtw-2  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 system\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 verifies\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 foundation.\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 SGOV\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Bank must\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 never drop below the \f7 $20,000 \f1 threshold. This is the psychological and mathematical anchor enabling zero-fear operation.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri537\sl240\slmult1\sb32\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Friday\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 Entry:\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Hunter\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 (Active\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Trading\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 Apparatus)\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 deploys the\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Friday\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 Ladder strategy, selling Cash-Secured Puts or Credit Spreads on highly liquid macro\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 indices (/MES, /MNQ).\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri791\sl240\slmult1\sb35\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Thursday Exit: \f1\b0 The Hunter closes the positions, successfully extracting raw cash premium from the derivatives market\'92s implied volatility.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri1046\sl240\slmult1\sb36\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Injection: \f1\b0 The extracted cash is immediately funneled into System 1 (The \expnd0\expndtw-2 Bank).\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery720\footery755\margtsxn960\margbsxn940\pgbrdropt32\pgbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp383\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp294\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp426\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp336\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb175\f1\fs28\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s5\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1{\*\bkmkstart CYCLE 2: THE COMPRESSION (System 1 - The}{\*\bkmkend CYCLE 2: THE COMPRESSION (System 1 - The}\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark74}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark74}\f2\fs28\b1\charscalex110\cf11 CYCLE\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 2:\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 THE\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 COMPRESSION\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \expnd0\expndtw0 (System\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 1\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 -\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 Bank\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 &\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Overflow)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\sb179\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The process\expnd0\expndtw2  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd0\expndtw2  \expnd0\expndtw0 securing\expnd1\expndtw4  \expnd0\expndtw0 capital\expnd1\expndtw4  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd1\expndtw5  \expnd0\expndtw0 mitigating\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 systemic\expnd0\expndtw1  \expnd0\expndtw-2 friction.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri476\sl240\slmult1\sb180\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 Sovereign Storage: \f1\b0 The injected cash is converted into SGOV. This capital now exists\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 state\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 \'93Quantum\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 Superposition,\'94\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 earning\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f7\expnd0\expndtw0 \uc1\u8764 ?\expnd3\expndtw14  \expnd0\expndtw0 5.2%\expnd-2\expndtw-8  \f1\expnd0\expndtw0 risk-free\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 yield\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 while simultaneously functioning as 100% margin collateral for the next Hunter cycle.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1080\fi-360\ri668\sl240\slmult1\sb38\tx1080\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Oxygen Supply: \f1\b0 The interest generated by SGOV autonomously pays the operating costs, taxes, and commissions of the active trading business, reducing the\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 Cognitive\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 Cost\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 (\f7 \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56374 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56374 ?\sub \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\f1\nosupersub )\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 to\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 zero.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1080\fi-360\ri593\sl240\slmult1\sb37\tx1080\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Overflow Mechanic: \f1\b0 As The Hunter continuously feeds The Bank, it breaches its optimal allocation threshold (75%). The excess liquidity mechanically washes over into System 2 (The Reactor).\par\pard\plain\s5\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\sb163{\*\bkmkstart CYCLE 3: THE EXHALATION (System 2 - The }{\*\bkmkend CYCLE 3: THE EXHALATION (System 2 - The }\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark75}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark75}\f2\fs28\b1\charscalex110\cf11 CYCLE\exp