cwrap\lnbrkrule\li1799\fi-360\ri946\qj\sl237\slmult1\sb33\tx1799\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 Dec 20 (The Pruning): \f1\i0 The Cannibal Mechanic executes. 50% of ABBV is liquidated \f7 \uc1\u8594 ? \f1 Cash to SGOV. 25% of JNJ is liquidated \f7 \uc1\u8594 ? \f1 Cash buys more \expnd0\expndtw-2 MO/SCHD.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1799\fi-360\ri600\sl232\slmult1\sb44\tx1799\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 Dec 28\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 (The Tax Deferred): \f1\i0 Idle Shield cash is parked in T-Bills maturing\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the following year.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls49\ilvl0\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri873\sl240\slmult1\sb39\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The\expnd6\expndtw28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Crossover\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 (Cosmological\expnd6\expndtw28  \expnd0\expndtw0 Scale):\expnd6\expndtw28  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd6\expndtw28  \expnd0\expndtw0 system\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 perpetually\expnd5\expndtw27  \expnd0\expndtw0 executes\expnd6\expndtw28  \expnd0\expndtw0 this\expnd6\expndtw28  \expnd0\expndtw0 3-stage pump until Year 15. At\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 this Topological Turning\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Point, the passive income generated\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 by\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 Reactor\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 (\f7 \uc1\u8764 ?\expnd4\expndtw19  \expnd0\expndtw0 $4,000/\f1 Month)\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 eclipses\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 active\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 income\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 The Hunter. System 3 becomes obsolete. The organism is fully self-sustaining.\par
