xpndtw0 Variable\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Shift: \f1\i0 The Friday \charscalex105 Fortress eliminates mutual funds. The new 7-asset matrix (SGOV, MO, SCHD, ABBV, JNJ, V, WMT) consists entirely of equities and ETFs.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri408\sl240\slmult1\sb170\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 [THREAD\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 BETA: SHIKAMARU\'92S\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 EYE - SNAKE LENS\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 /\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 Capital\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 Flow Dynamics]\expnd5\expndtw25  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw0 I am tracing the new kinetic pathways. By eliminating the multi-node requirement, the entire Friday Fortress can be deployed within a single, highly specialized derivatives hub (e.g.,\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Tastytrade or IBKR). The flow of capital is no longer bottlenecked. The 75% mass in SGOV sits in the exact same account where the options are written. The dividends from MO and ABBV\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 hit the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 account\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 immediately\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 expand the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 margin buying\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 power\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 exact\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 same \expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex85 day.\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \f7\expnd0\expndtw-2 \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\sub \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\nosupersub\charscalex100  \charscalex85 =\expnd-2\e