\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li359\sl240\slmult1\sb239{\*\bkmkstart ZENITSU METHOD 3.0 | PASS 2: UNDERSTANDI}{\*\bkmkend ZENITSU METHOD 3.0 | PASS 2: UNDERSTANDI}\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark97}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark97}\f2\fs28\b1\charscalex105\cf11 ZENITSU METHOD 3.0 \charscalex95 | \charscalex105 PASS 2: UNDERSTANDING (SHIKAMARU\'92S EYE -\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw-2 SYNTHESIS)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri369\sl240\slmult1\sb182\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 Lenses: Spider (Static Network Mapping) & Snake (Dynamic Process Flow) \charscalex95 | \charscalex105 Objective:\i1  Causal Flow, Systems Thinking, and Biological Parallels.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri387\sl240\slmult1\sb180\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 I am now tracking the dynamic, thermodynamic flow of capital within the system using the Snake Lens, overlaying biological isomorphisms and abstract system theory to explain \f4\i1 how\i1  \f1\i0 the machine breathes.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls52\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri538\sl247\slmult1\sb180\tx733\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Biological Isomorphism: The Cardiovascular Capital Pump \f1\b0 The Friday\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 Fortress\expnd16\expndtw80  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 operates in a continuous, three-stage thermodynamic cycle \charscalex90 (\f7 \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\sub \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\expnd8\expndtw40\nosupersub\charscalex100  \expnd0\expndtw0 = 0\f1 ), precisely \charscalex105 mirroring the human cardiovascular and digestive systems.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls52\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri619\sl240\slmult1\sb174\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\i0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Inhalation (System 3 - The Hunter): \f1\b0 The active trading apparatus operates in the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 external\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 environment\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 (the\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 lungs).\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 By\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 trading\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 /MES\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 /MNQ\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 on\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Friday-to-Thursday timeline, it extracts \'93oxygen\'94 (raw cash premium) from the implied volatility of the market.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls52\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri424\sl240\slmult1\sb39\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\i0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Circulation (System 1 - The Bank): \f1\b0 The extracted cash is pumped immediately into SGOV (the heart and bloodstream). Here, it achieves \f2\b1 Quantum Superposition Yields\f1\b0 . The blood (capital) is carrying oxygen (earning \f7 3.80% \f1 risk-free) \f4\i1 while\i1  simultaneously \f1\i0 being pumped to the muscles (margin collateral) to power the next \expnd0\expndtw-2 strike.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls52\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri470\sl240\slmult1\sb41\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\i0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Digestion & Metabolism (System 2 - The Reactor): \f1\b0 The Bank inevitably overflows.\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 This\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 excess\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 liquidity\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 shunted\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 into\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 Reactor\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 (the\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 digestive\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 tract).\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 The Reactor uses its internal components (MO, SCHD, ABBV, JNJ) to synthesize raw\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 cash into dense ATP (Dividend Yield).\par\pard\plain\s12\ls52\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri379\sl240\slmult1\sb40\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\i0\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex110 Autophagic\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Harvesting\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw-2 (The\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Cannibal\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Mechanic):\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw-2 In\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw-2 cellular\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw-2 biology,\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 autophagy\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw-2 is \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 the\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 body\'92s\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 process\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 clearing\expnd7\expndtw34  \expnd0\expndtw0 out\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 damaged\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 cells\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 regenerate\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 newer,\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 healthier cells.\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 Protocol\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 B\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 (The\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 Annual\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 Harvest\expnd7\expndtw34  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 December)\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 is\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 systemic\expnd8\expndtw38  \expnd0\expndtw0 financial\expnd7\expndtw36  \expnd0\expndtw0 autophagy. \charscalex110 By\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \expnd0\expndtw0 mechanically\expnd-3\expndtw-15  \expnd0\expndtw0 liquidating\expnd-3\expndtw-13  \expnd0\expndtw0 50%\expnd-3\expndtw-14  \expnd0\expnd