\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb10\f1\fs17\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\sb241{\*\bkmkstart ZENITSU METHOD 3.0 | PASS 2: UNDERSTANDI}{\*\bkmkend ZENITSU METHOD 3.0 | PASS 2: UNDERSTANDI}\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100{\*\bkmkstart _bookmark107}{\*\bkmkend _bookmark107}\f2\fs28\b1\charscalex105\cf11 ZENITSU\expnd5\expndtw25  \expnd0\expndtw0 METHOD\expnd4\expndtw20  \expnd0\expndtw0 3.0\expnd4\expndtw22  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex95 |\expnd4\expndtw20\charscalex105  \expnd0\expndtw0 PASS\expnd4\expndtw19  \expnd0\expndtw0 2:\expnd4\expndtw18  \expnd0\expndtw0 UNDERSTANDING\expnd5\expndtw24  \expnd0\expndtw0 (SHIKAMARU\'92S\expnd5\expndtw23  \expnd-1\expndtw-4 EYE)\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri369\sl240\slmult1\sb179\f4\fs24\b0\i1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 Lenses: Spider (Static Network Mapping) & Snake (Dynamic Process Flow) \charscalex95 | \charscalex105 Objective:\i1  Causal Flow, Systems Thinking, and Biological Parallels.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\sl240\slmult1\sb180\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 I am now tracking the dynamic, thermodynamic flow of capital within the system using the Snake Lens. I am overlaying biological isomorphisms and abstract system theory to explain exactly \f4\i1 how \f1\i0 this organism breathes and evolves.\par\pard\plain\s10\ls57\ilvl1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li732\fi-372\sl240\slmult1\sb181\tx732{\*\bkmkstart 2.1 The Biological Isomorphism: The Card}{\*\bkmkend 2.1 The Biological Isomorphism: The Card}\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100\f3\fs24\b1\i1\charscalex110\cf11 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Biological Isomorphism:\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 The\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Cardiovascular\expnd0\expndtw1  \expnd0\expndtw0 Capital \expnd-1\expndtw-4 Pump\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri387\sl254\slmult1\sb180\f1\fs24\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 Friday\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 Fortress\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 operates\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0\expndtw0 continuous,\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 three-stage\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 thermodynamic\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 cycle\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex90 (\f7 \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u57061 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56382 ?\sub \uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56422 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56400 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56417 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\uc1\u55349 ?\uc1\u56406 ?\expnd5\expndtw26\nosupersub\charscalex100  \expnd0\expndtw0 = \charscalex105 0\f1 ), precisely mirroring the human cardiovascular and digestive systems.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls57\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri608\sl240\slmult1\sb164\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Inhalation (System 3 - The Hunter): \f1\b0 The active trading apparatus operates in the external environment (the lungs). By trading derivatives (e.g., selling cash-secured puts/credit spreads on /MES or /MNQ) on a strict Friday-to-Thursday timeline,\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 it\expnd-2\expndtw-12  \expnd0\expndtw0 extracts\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 \'93oxygen\'94\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 (raw\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 cash\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 premium)\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 from\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd-2\expndtw-10  \expnd0\expndtw0 implied\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 volatility\expnd-2\expndtw-11  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-2\expndtw-9  \expnd0\expndtw0 the \expnd0\expndtw-2 market.\par\sect\sectd\sbkpage\headery720\footery755\margtsxn960\margbsxn940\pgbrdropt32\pgbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp383\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp294\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp426\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pgbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw30\brsp336\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14\brdrcf14 \pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb221\f1\fs24\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s12\ls57\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1080\fi-360\ri402\sl240\slmult1\tx1080\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Circulation (System 1 - The Bank): \f1\b0 The extracted cash is pumped immediately into SGOV (the heart and bloodstream). Here, it achieves \f2\b1 Quantum Superposition Yields\f1\b0 . The blood (capital) carries oxygen (earning \f7 5.20% \f1 risk-free) \f4\i1 while\i1  simultaneously \f1\i0 being\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 pumped\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 muscles\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 (providing margin\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 collateral)\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 to power the next strike.\par\pard\plain\s12\ls57\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri596\sl240\slmult1\sb40\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex105 The Digestion & Metabolism (System 2 - The Reactor): \f1\b0 The Bank inevitably overflows its optimal parameters. This excess\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 liquidity is shunted into the Reactor (the digestive tract). The Reactor uses its internal components to synthesize raw cash into dense ATP (Dividend Yield).\par\pard\plain\s12\ls57\ilvl2\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li1079\fi-360\ri381\sl240\slmult1\sb36\tx1079\f2\fs24\b1\expnd0\expndtw-2\charscalex110 Autophagic\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Harvesting\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw-2 (The\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Cannibal\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Mechanic):\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \f1\b0\expnd0\expndtw-2 In\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw-2 cellular\expnd-1\expndtw-7  \expnd0